        "cls": "elementor-widget-heading",
        "_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "html": "Santa Clarita’s Most Trusted Dental Experts"
       },
       {
        "_key": "62e5159",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
        "_type": "text",
        "html": "<p>Valencia Smile Expert has been proudly serving the community of Santa Clarita since 2007. Now led by Dr. Neda Moezzi, our team blends clinical precision and modern technology with a warm, one-on-one approach that makes every patient feel like family. Schedule your consultation or appointment with Dr. Moezzi today and become part of our growing family.</p>"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "_type": "box",
    "_key": "5e994cc",
    "cls": "e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent",
