         {
          "_key": "2869240",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-heading",
          "_type": "heading",
          "tag": "h3",
          "html": "Our Mission"
         },
         {
          "_key": "7ebb9bd",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
          "_type": "text",
          "html": "<p>From the beginning, Dr. Moezzi made it her mission to make high-quality dental care accessible, compassionate, and genuinely patient-centered. Whether you’re visiting for a routine cleaning or advanced cosmetic dentistry treatment, you’re going to feel totally comfortable, confident in our work, and fully cared for.</p>"
         }
        ]
       },
