     },
     {
      "_key": "fb3d636",
      "cls": "elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget-text-editor",
      "_type": "text",
      "html": "<p>At Valencia Smile Expert, you’ll never feel rushed or like just another appointment on the schedule. Dr. Moezzi takes the time to get to know you, understand your goals, and tailor each visit to your needs while developing a plan for your long-term health. As we like to say, we practice dentistry with heart—grounded in trust, empathy, and holistic-driven care.</p>"
