         {
          "_key": "931ab48",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-heading",
          "_type": "heading",
          "tag": "h3",
          "html": "Meet Your Dentist"
         },
         {
          "_key": "800161f",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
          "_type": "text",
          "html": "<p>Dr. Neda Moezzi, DDS, is the founder and lead provider at Valencia Smile Expert. A graduate of the University of Detroit Mercy Dental School, she is known for her compassionate care, technical precision, and the strong, long-term relationships she builds with her patients. From the first in-depth consultation to long-term treatment plans, Dr. Moezzi delivers care with intention, treating each patient like she would her own family.</p>"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "_type": "box",
