        "html": "Comfort Meets Innovation"
       },
       {
        "_key": "6b99c45",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
        "_type": "text",
        "html": "<p>Our office is equipped with the latest in dental technology—including 3D CBCT imaging, intraoral cameras, PRF therapy, and laser dentistry—to ensure safe, efficient, and minimally invasive care. Combined with a calming environment and multiple sedation options, we’re redefining what it means to “go to the dentist.”</p>"
